units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic

lattice bcc 1.0
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 75 units lattice
create_box 1 box
region target block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units lattice
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 55 75 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile

group target region target
group projectile region projectile

mass 1 92.906

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep 0.001

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix equil all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
run 10
unfix equil

velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 -20.0 sum yes

fix impact all nve
run 10
